  "capturedFrom": "Figma web, Plugin API via window.figma, in a scratch file built by design/figma-plugin",
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "notes": [
    "Durations are seconds, stored as float32: 0.2 reads back as 0.20000000298023224 and Figma shows 200ms.",
    "ON_HOVER is the UI's 'While hovering'. A variant's hover is a NODE action with navigation CHANGE_TO to the hover variant.",
    "Spring presets (GENTLE here) store only their type. Figma shows them at 1200ms whatever duration is stored.",
    "CUSTOM_SPRING takes mass, stiffness and damping only; initialVelocity is rejected.",
    "Colours are 0-1 rounded to 3 places. 'variable' is the token variable a paint is bound to; boundVariables lists bound fields.",
    "Card is an author component: Size=Small hover changes fill (unbound), corner radius (unbinds it), shadow style, Accent width and opacity; Size=Large hover also changes the Title text, which does not translate."
  ],
